 "description": "This is the life the award-winning Aquila 54 Yacht power catamaran is made for: long-range escapes, effortless entertaining, and those moments when comfort, capability, and beauty all converge.\nWith unmatched stability across its impressive 25'2\" beam, this remarkable yacht makes every mile feel like a reward. The panoramic salon with full-size refrigeration and oversized sliding doors flows seamlessly to the expansive cockpit. Above, the flybridge becomes your elevated social hub with multiple seating areas and wet bar.\nAvailable in 3, 4, and 5-cabin options as well as skipper's quarters and \"galley-down\" layouts to match your cruising lifestyle. The full-beam master suite offers privacy, while thoughtful touches throughout create a genuine sense of home.\nWith smart navigation systems and Category A ocean certification, the Aquila 54 gives you everything needed to roam farther and feel completely at home along the way.\nBecause out there, wonder awaits.",
